  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "複合材料學",
    "sub_ename": "COMPOSITE MATERIALS",
    "describe_ch": "建立學生對複合材料基本的概念外，並對樹脂基材和補強材的結構、種類與功能、,還有複合材料的介面性質、加工方法與應用做一探討。 完成此一課程同學將可了解複合材料的基本結構組成, 應用範圍與並可描述複合材料與他種材料性質之差異。\r瞭解複合材料組成、特性、補強材與樹脂性能、設計概念、製造方法、機械性質測試與評估方法、加工與組裝等知識。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "The aims of this course are to establish the basic concepts of composite materials and to investigate the structure/function, kinds of matrix/reinforcements and interface property and processes of composite materials. When students complete this course, s/he should be able to：understand the fundamental construction of composites; identify several uses of composites; describe composites and distinguish composites from other materials.\r\nThe aims of this course are teaching students to understand the knowledge of composite composition and characteristics, reinforcement and resin properties, design concept, manufacturing methods, mechanical property testing and evaluation, composite materials assembly etc.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解何謂複合材料，且能夠描述複合材料之機械性質",
      "describe_en": "Understand what are composite materials and be able to describe how the mechanical properties of composite materials."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解複合材料之組成、應用與加工技術及其原理",
      "describe_en": "Understand what are the composition and applications of composite materials and principles of composite processes."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "能瞭解複合材料之機械性質測試與評估方法",
      "describe_en": "Understand the test methods and evaluation of mechanical properties of composite materials."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "訓練學生能和同儕、及教師討論相關作業問題之解答",
      "describe_en": "Training the students can to discuss the solution procedures for homework problems with classmates, and the instructor."
    }
  ],
